    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_metal_machinery_hardware): Unenumerated metal manufactures belong with Metalwares (as htc:0270 Iron Manufactures Unenumerated already does), not with paper/glass/sundries. Layer-1 observations: 93 rows, 1871–1897. Series: HCPP_Annual Statement of Trade ×23; CSP_Canadian Trade and Navigation ×7; CSP_Canadian_Exports_BlankSeries (inferred, series not printed) ×63. Units: (no unit) ×93. Top routes: World → United Kingdom ×6; Quebec → All Countries ×6; Canada → United States ×4; Canada → Newfoundland ×4."@en ;
